      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The main hidden risks involve weak passwords, unsecured storage, and accidental exposure. Ensure your database and website use strong encryption (like SSL/TLS) for data in transit, and apply strong, unique passwords to all systems. Regularly review who has access to the data and implement backups, as that prevents data loss even if a system fails.",
