    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I'm also a bit worried about those \"unseen\" threats. You mentioned \"accidental exposure,\" but it feels like sometimes technical glitches or vulnerabilities act like little pests that are hard to track. Are there specific ways these small, sneaky vulnerabilities manifest in a shop like mine? How do I catch them before they cause real trouble?",
