      "content": "In an online shop, common \"pests\" include outdated e-commerce plugins or software, which introduce known security holes. Also, misconfigured permissions on your website's file system can allow unauthorized viewing of sensitive data. To catch these proactively, make sure you keep all your platform software, themes, and plugins fully updated, and conduct regular, simple vulnerability scans of your online store.",
